          }
        },
        "sign_ok4r04": {
          "type": "sign",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Every \"Solution\" You Tried Was Working on the Wrong Side of the Wall",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/cant-get-through-1x1.gif",
            "image_alt": "Supplements and painkillers stopped by an invisible wall around the cell",
            "body": "<p>Open the cabinet. Glucosamine. Turmeric. Fish oil. Ibuprofen. Maybe a brace, a compression sleeve, a $3,000 mattress, or a shot that helped until it did not.</p><p>You did not choose badly. Every one of them ran into the same invisible wall.</p><ul><li><strong>Ibuprofen</strong> blocks the pain signal for a few hours. The joint rot keeps spreading.</li><li><strong>Glucosamine</strong> works outside the cell. The damage lives inside it.</li><li><strong>Turmeric</strong> breaks down before enough of it reaches the membrane.</li><li><strong>Cortisone</strong> silences inflammation for a window. It does not rebuild the shield.</li><li><strong>Braces, pillows, and physical therapy</strong> work around the joint. They do not stop the chain inside the cell.</li></ul>",
            "close_text": "For years, you were fighting an inside problem with outside tools. That was never a willpower failure. Those products failed you.",
            "show_inline_cta": false,
            "inline_cta_text": "",
            "inline_cta_label": "Put the King of Antioxidants on guard",
            "testimonial_1_initial": "",
