        "sign_ok4r06": {
          "type": "sign",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Your Mirror Is One Of The First Places Oxidative Damage Shows Up",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/wrinkles-uv.jpg",
            "image_alt": "Astaxanthin protecting skin cells beneath the surface",
            "body": "<p>Fine lines do not begin on the surface. Dryness does not begin in the moisturizer aisle. The visible signs of aging start deeper, when UV exposure and oxidative stress damage the cells responsible for hydration, elasticity, and repair.</p><p>Astaxanthin began as nature's answer to brutal sunlight. Microalgae make it when UV stress becomes so intense that survival is on the line.</p><p>Inside human skin, the same antioxidant has been studied for crow's feet, elasticity, hydration, and protection from UV-driven damage. Research reports visible crow's-feet reduction in as little as six weeks at 6mg per day.</p><p><strong>REVELLA delivers 12mg.</strong></p>",
            "close_text": "Creams sit on top of yesterday's damage. Astaxanthin helps defend the living cells creating tomorrow's skin.",
            "show_inline_cta": true,
            "inline_cta_text": "Your skin, heart, eyes, energy, and joints all depend on the same cellular walls.",
            "inline_cta_label": "Put the King of Antioxidants on guard",
            "testimonial_1_initial": "",
