          "settings": {
            "heading": "REVELLA Turns Okinawa's Daily Red Shield Into One Full-Strength Softgel",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/12mg-once-daily-grandma.jpg",
            "image_alt": "REVELLA astaxanthin softgel with microalgae and astaxanthin-rich foods",
            "body": "<p>You could try to eat wild salmon, shrimp, shellfish, and sea vegetables every day.</p><p>Or you could take one softgel with a meal.</p><p>REVELLA uses natural astaxanthin grown from <em>Haematococcus pluvialis</em> microalgae, the original source beneath the food chain. Every softgel delivers a full <strong>12mg</strong>, not the 4mg label-dressing dose found in many competing products.</p><p>One natural ingredient. One softgel a day. Third-party tested. No filler parade. No proprietary blend hiding how little you are actually getting.</p><p>The benefit is not another bottle in the cabinet. It is waking up with more left in the tank. Seeing a face in the mirror that looks closer to how you feel inside. Finishing a screen-heavy day without rubbing your eyes raw. Moving without negotiating with every joint first.</p>",
