        "collapsible_row_custom_aagMJW": {
          "type": "collapsible_row_custom",
          "settings": {
            "icon_1": "shopify://shop_images/ant-design_product-filled.svg",
            "q_1": "Natural Astaxanthin 12mg",
            "a_1": "<p><strong>Natural Astaxanthin 12mg</strong> from Haematococcus pluvialis microalgae. Sunflower oil for absorption. Softgel capsule (gelatin, purified water). That's it.</p><p>No fillers. No synthetic astaxanthin. No artificial anything. 30 softgels per bag, full 1-month supply. Non-GMO, gluten-free, soy-free.</p>",
            "icon_2": "shopify://shop_images/mingcute_question-fill.svg",
            "q_2": "Clean & Trusted",
            "a_2": "<p>cGMP certified, FDA-registered facility. 3rd party lab tested every batch. Oil-based softgel for real absorption, not powder capsules that pass right through you. We sell direct only. No Amazon, no middlemen.</p>",
            "icon_3": "shopify://shop_images/mingcute_bug-fill.svg",
            "q_3": "How Does It Work on Joints?",
            "a_3": "<p>Joint pain isn't surface soreness. The real damage happens inside the cell membrane of your cartilage and tendon, where oxidative stress silently breaks down the tissue from within. That's why the pain keeps coming back. Nothing you've put on or swallowed has reached it.</p><p>Most solutions work on the surface. They mute the signal without touching the source. The moment they wear off, the destruction picks right back up.</p><p>Astaxanthin is one of the only compounds on earth that's both fat-soluble and water-soluble at the same time. That's what lets it physically cross into the cartilage and tendon cells where the damage is actually happening. Once inside, it neutralizes the free radicals driving the breakdown, halts the inflammation at the source, and protects the tissue from further damage.</p><p>It doesn't mask the pain. It removes the reason the pain exists.</p>",
            "icon_4": "shopify://shop_images/mdi_thunder-circle.svg",
            "q_4": "How Long Before I See Results?",
            "a_4": "<p>Most people feel a shift within days, because astaxanthin reaches the cells nothing else has.</p><p><strong>First few days:</strong> Stiffness begins to ease. Joints feel less locked when you wake up. A lot of people start realizing the things they blamed on \"just getting older\" weren't age at all.</p><p><strong>Week 1–2:</strong> Mobility increases substantially. Daily pain calms. Nighttime aching settles. People who haven't slept through the night in months start getting real rest.</p><p><strong>Week 3–4:</strong> Astaxanthin keeps building in your joint tissue. It doesn't flush out like other supplements. Movement gets noticeably easier. Activities you'd quietly given up start coming back on their own.</p><p><strong>Week 5–6+:</strong> The inflammation cycle is broken. Most people stop thinking about their joints entirely. They're just living again.</p><p>Cellular protection compounds. Don't quit early. You're protected by a 60-day guarantee either way.</p>",
            "icon_5": "shopify://shop_images/Group.svg",
            "q_5": "Recommended Use",
            "a_5": "<p>One softgel a day. Take it with a meal that has fat (eggs, avocado, salmon, olive oil, peanut butter). Astaxanthin is fat-soluble, so it absorbs 3-4x better with food fats. Morning or night, doesn't matter. Pick a time you'll remember.</p><p>That's it. No stack. No timing tricks. One pill, one meal, every day.</p>",
            "icon_6": "shopify://shop_images/Vector.svg",
            "q_6": "Do You Offer a Guarantee?",
            "a_6": "<p>30 days. Full refund. No questions. If your joints don't move easier, your stiffness doesn't ease, or your pain doesn't calm, we refund every penny. Even if the bag is empty.<br/><br/></p>",
            "q_7": "",
            "a_7": "",
            "q_8": "",
            "a_8": "",
            "q_9": "",
            "a_9": "",
            "q_10": "",
            "a_10": "",
